        <tr><td>{f}</td><td class="cap">{c}</td><td class="m">{a}</td></tr>))}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="cap">FamilySearch arks resolve at <span class="m">familysearch.org/ark:/61903/&lt;reference&gt;</span>.
    Collections citing the <em>State Archives, Cape Province</em> and <em>Pietermaritzburg Archives</em> are
    named as FamilySearch gives them.</p>
</section>

